# title: Rainbow call (50/30/20)
# category: Multi-asset
# underlyings: 3
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call on a basket whose weights go by rank: 50% on the best performer, 30% on the second, 20% on the worst.
#
# Notional 1000. With three stocks the middle performer is the sum minus
# the best and the worst.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot(0)
    s1 = spot(1)
    s2 = spot(2)

2028-01-04
    p0 = spot(0) / s0
    p1 = spot(1) / s1
    p2 = spot(2) / s2
    best = max(p0, max(p1, p2))
    worst = min(p0, min(p1, p2))
    middle = p0 + p1 + p2 - best - worst
    pays 1000 * max(0.5 * best + 0.3 * middle + 0.2 * worst - 1, 0)
